@startuml Admin_Itinerary_Management_SSD

actor "Administrator" as Admin
participant "UI: Itinerary Management" as UI
participant "Database" as DB
participant "S3 Storage" as S3

== View Itineraries ==

Admin -> UI: Access itinerary management
activate UI

UI -> DB: Fetch all pins (sites)
activate DB
DB --> UI: Return pins list
deactivate DB

UI -> DB: Fetch active itineraries
activate DB
DB --> UI: Return active itineraries
deactivate DB

UI -> DB: Fetch archived itineraries
activate DB
DB --> UI: Return archived itineraries
deactivate DB

UI --> Admin: Display form and itinerary lists (Active/Archived tabs)
deactivate UI

== Add Itinerary ==

Admin -> UI: Enter itinerary details\n(name, description, duration, image, select sites)
activate UI

UI -> UI: Validate input

alt Input valid
    UI --> Admin: Show confirmation dialog
    Admin -> UI: Confirm add
    
    UI -> S3: Upload cover image
    activate S3
    S3 --> UI: Return S3 URL
    deactivate S3
    
    UI -> DB: Save itinerary record
    activate DB
    DB --> UI: Itinerary created
    deactivate DB
    
    UI --> Admin: Show success, refresh list
else Input invalid
    UI --> Admin: Show validation errors
end

deactivate UI

== Edit Itinerary ==

Admin -> UI: Click "Edit" on itinerary
activate UI

UI -> UI: Populate form with current data

UI --> Admin: Display filled form

Admin -> UI: Modify details and submit

UI --> Admin: Show confirmation dialog
Admin -> UI: Confirm update

alt New image uploaded
    UI -> S3: Delete old image
    activate S3
    deactivate S3
    
    UI -> S3: Upload new image
    activate S3
    S3 --> UI: Return new S3 URL
    deactivate S3
end

UI -> DB: Update itinerary record
activate DB
DB --> UI: Itinerary updated
deactivate DB

UI --> Admin: Show success, refresh list
deactivate UI

== Archive Itinerary ==

Admin -> UI: Click "Archive"
activate UI

UI --> Admin: Show confirmation dialog
Admin -> UI: Confirm archive

UI -> DB: Update itinerary (archived: true)
activate DB
DB --> UI: Itinerary archived
deactivate DB

UI --> Admin: Refresh lists
deactivate UI

== Restore Itinerary ==

Admin -> UI: Switch to Archived tab
activate UI

Admin -> UI: Click "Restore"
UI --> Admin: Show confirmation dialog
Admin -> UI: Confirm restore

UI -> DB: Update itinerary (archived: false)
activate DB
DB --> UI: Itinerary restored
deactivate DB

UI --> Admin: Refresh lists
deactivate UI

== Delete Itinerary ==

Admin -> UI: Click "Delete" on archived itinerary
activate UI

UI --> Admin: Show warning dialog
Admin -> UI: Confirm delete

UI -> S3: Delete cover image
activate S3
deactivate S3

UI -> DB: Remove itinerary record
activate DB
DB --> UI: Itinerary deleted
deactivate DB

UI --> Admin: Refresh archived list
deactivate UI

@enduml
